# tebox: MagicOS's init loads /system/build.prop (all of ro.build.*) and the
# cust layers' prop/local.prop only from its Honor cust-policy walk, which a
# GSI on this vendor never reaches; KeyMint then waits forever for
# ro.build.version.release. system_ext's build.prop is loaded normally, right
# after where system's would be, so this copy carries all of them
# (bind-mounted by the initramfs from qemu/init/system-overlay). Cust layers
# follow /system/magic/parent_cust.cfg: china_honor -> china -> base, the more
# specific one winning: read-only properties keep their first value, so the
# layers' ro.* come first (specific to generic); the others keep their last
# value, so they come last (generic to specific).

# ---- cust ro.*: china_honor, china, base ----
